steps.instructions:
Your chart's diamond becomes an if/else here. You have not been taught this as code yet - Chapter 2 does that properly - so here is the exact shape to copy and fill in:

if (SOMETHING IS TRUE) {
  console.log("what happens on the yes branch");
} else {
  console.log("what happens on the no branch");
}

Replace the condition with your comparison, and put a message in each branch. Both branches must print something.
